  "title": "House Oversight Committee Urges DOJ to Investigate Key Epstein Witnesses",
  "summary": "The House Oversight Committee criticizes the U.S. Department of Justice for failing to address the criminal investigations into Jeffrey Epstein and his associate Ghislaine Maxwell, calling for the government to interview key witnesses and ensure survivors have access to their records.",
